<title>USA: Covalent gets $3.5 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Covalent gets $3.5 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covalent Research Alliance Corporation, a subsidiary of Covalent Group Inc said Monday that it has signed a contract to conduct $3.5 million in clinical development studies for a Fortune 500 pharmaceutical company.</p>
<p>The addition of the new studies increases the company's backlog to $14 million.</p>
</text>
